<title>POLAND: Ferrum Q2 net falls to PLN 2.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Ferrum Q2 net falls to PLN 2.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huta Ferrum preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.11 vs     3.09</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.66 vs     2.94</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.00 vs     2.85</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Huta Ferrum SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 47.23 vs    40.03</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  39.64 vs    34.01</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.10 vs     0.01 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.66 vs     0.10</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.72 vs     3.22</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.08 vs     3.38</p>
<p>    investment				 2.71 vs     0.17</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 4.43 vs     4.90</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   6.06 vs     4.50</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.32 vs     3.50</p>
<p>    net sales				 85.95 vs    73.49</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  71.61 vs    62.24</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.10 vs     0.06 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.74 vs     1.00</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     3.63 vs     3.67</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.91 vs     4.14</p>
<p>    investment				 4.02 vs     1.46</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
